ublishing.com/chosun/HFTDANLEMMZTCNZQMNTGIYTCGU.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/G4ZTGNJZMM2DSYLCGU3DCOLCGE/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;President Lee said that 'Wang Sanam' exceeded 10 million, saying, "Achievement in two years... Congratulations and gratitude"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/G4ZTGNJZMM2DSYLCGU3DCOLCGE/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;李 대통령, ‘왕사남’ 1000만 돌파에 “2년 만의 성과… 축하와 감사”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/ZPYQHVBEY3TU4O3FLHJ3W2UBJI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2026/03/06/GIKDB5VPPBAS3E7CKDDHNENHFY/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;"It's the same when you're old," breaking the stereotype, the elderly became healthier&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2026/03/06/GIKDB5VPPBAS3E7CKDDHNENHFY/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;“늙으면 다 그렇지” 고정관념 깼더니 노인 더 건강해졌다&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/AN6HDQM7HBM5ZIJXCY73LKZYVU.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/MLYTXWN7Z5FWTBGCILTIW4GWDE/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;U.S. oil soared 12% in one day alone, breaking through $90... Crude oil supply dries up&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/MLYTXWN7Z5FWTBGCILTIW4GWDE/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;美유가 하루에만 12% 급등해 90달러 돌파…원유 공급이 말라간다&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/HEIF7WO355OCRC25UVXGRP5J3U.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt